    Executive: board-trail index robustness + scheduled refresh + #310/#313 §8 (assignment B)
    
    Fix the §7 generator/§5 lens transient-board-error false gap
    (records/BOARD-TRAIL-INDEX-2026-10-21-staleness-and-flakiness.md):
    - board-trail-index.py: bounded board-call retry; per-issue board_readable;
      git_only_gap is enacted AND board_readable AND not terminal (a failed board
      call can no longer fabricate a gap);
    - board-trail-check.sh (§5 lens): retry; a persistent failure emits an
      unreadable row instead of aborting the lens;
    - judiciary-measurements.py: exclude unreadable issues from gap/rate metrics
      and report board_unreadable separately;
    - schedule §7 regeneration each measurement window via
      government/board-trail-refresh.sh, invoked (throttled, non-fatal) from boot.sh.
    Tests: board-trail-board-error-smoke.sh, board-trail-refresh-smoke.sh (hermetic).

